          <li>Made the game statistics in the compact mode into cards</li>
          <li>Made miscellaneous style changes</li>
          <li>Added a focus ring to the game cards</li>
          <li>Documented the Return key shortcut for starting a game</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
